        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Copilot Fusion is generally available.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Instead of picking a model for each task, choose Copilot Fusion and let Copilot intelligently route and orchestrate which models it uses for you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Fusion brings together Project HydraFusion&rsquo;s multi-model orchestration and Copilot auto model selection&rsquo;s fine-tuned model selection, leveraging the benefits of both to balance performance and cost efficiency.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index, Copilot Fusion Max scored 60, within two points of Claude Code with Opus 5.5 Max.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Administrators control which models Copilot Fusion can use and whether Copilot Fusion is the default.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprise administrators can view what models Copilot Fusion picks from, independently set each model&rsquo;s effective policy state, and disable models for Copilot Fusion without disabling the model for everyone.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Administrators can set Copilot Fusion, at any effort level, as the default model for Copilot users with Enterprise managed settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For a limited time, users on paid Copilot plans will receive a 30% discount on model costs when using Copilot Fusion.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:59.998Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Fusion is available on all Copilot plans in Visual Studio Code, the GitHub Copilot app, GitHub Copilot CLI, and JetBrains IDEs.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-route-and-orchestrate-models-with-github-copilot-fusion",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
